{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_01",
      "hash": "43e9080775e6fb2f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社长：喔～！小伙子！\\n多亏有你我才能得救！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_02",
      "hash": "43e9090775e6fce2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社长：喔～！小姑娘！\\n多亏有你我才能得救！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0950_partner_a_01",
      "hash": "c9f6ab0c5f166b39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "皮卡皮卡！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0950_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "1c046af0a3c5ef46",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "布伊布伊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_08",
      "hash": "43e90f0775e70714",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哇哈哈！看来不该说“你”，\\n而应该说“你们”啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_05",
      "hash": "43e9040775e6f463",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我永远都会记得，\\n在最危急的时候，\\r\\n是你们勇敢地帮助了我！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_06",
      "hash": "43e9050775e6f616",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦！对了！\\n我必须得好好谢谢你！\\c\\n我是个大方的人，\\n你想要什么我都可以给你。\\c\\n比如说这个，\\n你看看还满意吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0950_sys_01",
      "hash": "f506055ea4260db4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从社长那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]大师球[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_03",
      "hash": "43e90a0775e6fe95",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社长：这是大师球！\\n它是我们秘密研发中的样品，\\r\\n去哪里都买不到喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_07",
      "hash": "43e9060775e6f7c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要投掷出去，\\n就肯定能把宝可梦捕捉到手！\\c\\n……其实我们也就\\n只制造出这么一个成品喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_09",
      "hash": "43e9100775e708c7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你就偷偷地……\\n偷偷地用一用吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_04",
      "hash": "43e9030775e6f2b0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社长：噢！\\n解救了西尔佛的恩人！\\r\\n之前真是谢谢你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_10",
      "hash": "43ec8d0775ea1305",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社长：噢～～！\\n请你等一等！\\r\\n让我好好报答你吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_workerm1_01_p04_cave_d1011",
      "hash": "d2eb872ba95fcdcc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 13]"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0950_stafff_01",
      "hash": "079f21ac444df12d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "秘书：这次能平安获救，\\n真的非常感谢你！\\c\\n社长及全体员工\\n都对你表示衷心的感谢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0950_stafff_02",
      "hash": "079f1eac444dec14",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "秘书：一定能够\\n捉到宝可梦的精灵球……\\c\\n如果不是实力雄厚的训练家，\\n也没有使用它的资格。\\c\\n社长正是因为看中你的实力，\\n才会把大师球送给你的。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0950_max",
      "hash": "149c479c26cfcd99"
    }
  ]
}
